      "description": "A woman is seen applying makeup while looking into an ornate gold-framed mirror. Her reflection is visible, showing her from a slightly different angle as she holds a makeup brush and a compact palette. The scene is set indoors, with a chandelier and a door visible in the background, suggesting a private, domestic space. The visual composition focuses on the act of grooming, which is juxtaposed with the hateful text overlay 'i'm going trans hunting'.",
