      "instance_name": "transgender_community",
      "label": "Transgender Community",
      "description": "The meme targets the transgender community, a specific group defined by their gender identity. The phrase 'trans hunting' is a direct attack on this community, implying they are targets of violence or discrimination. Understanding the meme requires knowledge of who transgender people are and the real-world harm associated with such rhetoric.",
