      "instance_name": "hateful_meme_intention",
      "label": "Hateful Meme Intention",
      "description": "The meme is designed to spread prejudice and normalize negative attitudes toward transgender people. This requires understanding that memes can be used as tools of hate speech and that the intent behind the image and text is to incite hostility and harm, which is not visually depicted but is central to interpreting the meme.",
